<Base title="Disclosure — DeveX Tools" description="Editorial disclosure for DeveX Tools. Learn about our review processes, affiliate relationships, and editorial independence.">
  <div class="container" style="padding-top: 32px; max-width: 740px; margin: 40px auto;">
    <h1 class="page-title">Editorial Disclosure</h1>

    <section style="margin: 32px 0; color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.7;">
      <p style="margin-bottom: 16px;"><strong>DeveX Tools is committed to transparency.</strong> Here's how our reviews and recommendations work:</p>

      <ul style="padding-left: 20px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 16px;">
        <li><strong>Zero sponsored placements.</strong> No tool can pay to appear on DeveX. Every review is independent.</li>
        <li><strong>No affiliate relationships.</strong> We currently do not participate in any affiliate or referral programs. We do not earn commissions from tool purchases or sign-ups.</li>
        <li><strong>No influence on ratings.</strong> Tools are reviewed solely on merit. Our editorial content is 100% independent.</li>
        <li><strong>No advertising.</strong> This site currently displays no advertisements and participates in no affiliate or referral programs. We do not earn commissions from tool purchases, sign-ups, or third-party ads.</li>
      </ul>

      <p>Our content is produced by practicing engineers and reflects their genuine opinions. If you have questions, contact <a href="mailto:info@devex-tools.net">info@devex-tools.net</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>
